    value: 18
  - key: PressureKettleEffect.FixedUpdate.4
    label: FixedUpdate / int count = Physics2D.CircleCast(from, 0.12f, delta.normalized,
      filter, casts, delta.magnitude);
    source: Assets/Projects/Scripts/Enemy/PressureKettle/PressureKettleEffect.cs:126
    value: 0.12
  - key: PressureKettleEffect.FixedUpdate.5
    label: FixedUpdate / RaycastHit2D hit = casts[nearest]; transform.position =
